      "text": "The distance of a focus from the centre in <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></msub></math> is <math><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>32</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
