    },
    {
      "id": "i3rbi",
      "text": "<math><mrow><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow></munderover><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>,</mo></mrow></mrow></math> for each positive integer <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>",
